    "content": "Chain-of-Thought (CoT):CoT is a prompting approach that often enhances LLM problem-solving by instructing the model to generate intermediate steps [10, 11, 15]. We provided additionalassistance using the few-shot paradigm, designing a 3-shot CoT prompt that gives the model a diverseset of worked examples. We chose three examples to limit prompt length and because prior worksuggests that performance gains tend to diminish beyond a few examples [10, 31]. Our selectedexamples feature diverse board configurations and, critically, showcase complete solutions of varyinglengths—3, 5, and 6 moves—and slightly different strategies to teach the model flexible and adaptivereasoning. The full prompt is available in Appendix A.2.",
